[en.IDEA_CATEGORY_ERA_COLD]
Cold Resistance

[en.IDEA_CATEGORY_ERA_COLD_WINTER_TOOLTIP]
It’s §Ywinter§! now, we can’t change our §Ycold resistance policy§!.

[en.IDEA_CATEGORY_ERA_COLD__cost_factor]
Cold Resistance Policy Cost

[en.IDEA_CATEGORY_ERA_COLD_desc]


[en.IDEA_ERA_COLD_1_COAL]
Coal Heating

[en.IDEA_ERA_COLD_1_COAL_desc]
Three months of winter coolness and awesome holidays.
We’ve kept our hoofsies warm at home, time off from work to play.

[en.IDEA_ERA_COLD_1_COAL_TOOLTIP]
The government’s heating is enough to protect our citizens from the cold in most cases, but during the very very very cold §Ywinter§! months, it can still lead to §Rbad results§!. Such as frostbite, death, or even worse — complaints.

[en.IDEA_ERA_COLD_2_WOOD]
Wood Heating

[en.IDEA_ERA_COLD_2_WOOD_desc]
Three months of winter coolness and awesome holidays.
We’ve kept our hoofsies warm at home, time off from work to play.

[en.IDEA_ERA_COLD_2_WOOD_TOOLTIP]
The government’s heating is enough to protect our citizens from the cold in most cases, but during the very very very cold §Ywinter§! months, it can still lead to §Rbad results§!. Such as frostbite, death, or even worse — complaints.

[en.IDEA_ERA_COLD_3_SUBSIDY]
Heating Subsidy

[en.IDEA_ERA_COLD_3_SUBSIDY_desc]
Better than nothing.

[en.IDEA_ERA_COLD_3_SUBSIDY_TOOLTIP]
Citizens are left to solve their own heating problems, but the government provides a subsidy. A small subsidy may not be enough, which during the extremely cold §Ywinter§! months, can lead to §Rbad results§!. Such as frostbite, death, or even worse — complaints.

[en.IDEA_ERA_COLD_4_SELF]
On Your Own

[en.IDEA_ERA_COLD_4_SELF_desc]
The law, in its majestic equality, forbids rich and poor alike to sleep under bridges, to beg in the streets, and to steal firewood to keep them warm.

[en.IDEA_ERA_COLD_4_SELF_TOOLTIP]
Citizens are left to solve their own heating problems, which during the cold §Ywinter§! months, can lead to §Rbad results§!. Such as frostbite, death, or even worse — complaints.

[en.IDEA_ERA_COLD_5_BURN]
Dance, Like Nobody’s Watching

[en.IDEA_ERA_COLD_5_BURN_desc]
So burn us in the furnace
Let our souls ignite the flame
Use our bones to stoke the embers
Use our blood to oil the chains
We are nothing now but engines
Rending flesh to find a way
And as we fall, we know we die —
To light a brighter day

[zh.IDEA_CATEGORY_ERA_COLD]
耐寒政策

[zh.IDEA_CATEGORY_ERA_COLD_WINTER_TOOLTIP]
现在正值§Y冬天§!，我们不能修改我们的§Y耐寒政策§!。

[zh.IDEA_CATEGORY_ERA_COLD__cost_factor]
耐寒政策花费

[zh.IDEA_CATEGORY_ERA_COLD_desc]


[zh.IDEA_ERA_COLD_1_COAL]
烧煤供暖

[zh.IDEA_ERA_COLD_1_COAL_desc]
三个月的寒冷冬季，与快乐的节假。
我们躲在温暖的家里，停下工作去玩耍。

[zh.IDEA_ERA_COLD_1_COAL_TOOLTIP]
政府的供暖在绝大多数情况下足够保护我们的公民免受寒冷，但这在非常非常非常寒冷的§Y冬天§!依然可能会导致他们§R不好的结果§!。例如冻伤、死亡、甚至是更糟糕的——抱怨。

[zh.IDEA_ERA_COLD_2_WOOD]
烧柴供暖

[zh.IDEA_ERA_COLD_2_WOOD_desc]
三个月的寒冷冬季，与快乐的节假。
我们躲在温暖的家里，停下工作去玩耍。

[zh.IDEA_ERA_COLD_2_WOOD_TOOLTIP]
政府的供暖在绝大多数情况下足够保护我们的公民免受寒冷，但这在非常非常非常寒冷的§Y冬天§!依然可能会导致他们§R不好的结果§!。例如冻伤、死亡、甚至是更糟糕的——抱怨。

[zh.IDEA_ERA_COLD_3_SUBSIDY]
供暖补助

[zh.IDEA_ERA_COLD_3_SUBSIDY_desc]
总比没有要强

[zh.IDEA_ERA_COLD_3_SUBSIDY_TOOLTIP]
市民们的取暖问题将交主要由他们自己解决，但政府会提供补助。少量的补助可能会不足够，这在极度寒冷的§Y冬天§!可能会导致他们§R不好的结果§!。例如冻伤、死亡、甚至是更糟糕的——抱怨。

[zh.IDEA_ERA_COLD_4_SELF]
自生自灭

[zh.IDEA_ERA_COLD_4_SELF_desc]
法律，以其庄严的平等，禁止贫穷的小马同样也禁止富有的小马在桥下睡觉、沿街乞讨和偷窃柴火取暖。

[zh.IDEA_ERA_COLD_4_SELF_TOOLTIP]
市民们的取暖问题将交由他们自己解决，这在寒冷的§Y冬天§!可能会导致他们§R不好的结果§!。例如冻伤、死亡、甚至是更糟糕的——抱怨。

[zh.IDEA_ERA_COLD_5_BURN]
起舞，如无观者

[zh.IDEA_ERA_COLD_5_BURN_desc]
于是，在熔炉中焚烧我们吧
让我们的灵魂点燃火焰
用我们的骨头煽动余烬
用我们的血液润滑锁链
我们现在一无是处，只能化作引擎
撕裂我们的血肉，方能找到出路
当我们倒下时，我们知道我们会——
点亮更美好的明天
